                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "UPvTi",
                      "name": "🚨SlowMist TI Alert🚨\n\n💸 @aave v3 Loop Safe Module Loss: ~114.09 ETH\n\n🔍 Root Cause: FlashLoopAdapter's open()/close() access control only checks ISafe(msg.sender).isModuleEnabled(address(this)), which is spoofable via a fake Safe…",
