                      "content": "Thanks @cypherr.eth, for sharing Hayden's response and Lefteris follow-up. Hayden's points about avoiding impersonators seem to make sense. I can imagine if you're Uniswap, you need quick and brutal enforcement; otherwise, impersonators might DDoS attack...",
